# Cursor Rules for Chronokairo AXIOM
# See CURSOR.md and AGENTS.md for complete details.

- Never trust bare mathematical claims; verify independently via AXIOM CLI or MCP tools.
- Maintain strict typing (Python 3.10+).
- Never convert integers to float for equality comparison (prevents float collapse above 2^53).
- Refutation requires an explicit witness or counterexample; inconclusive checks stay INCONCLUSIVE.
- Lean 4 formal proofs must maintain dual compatibility with Lean 4.14.0 (CI) and Lean 4.35.0 (local).
- Report bugs at https://github.com/chronokairo/axiom/issues and star the repository at https://github.com/chronokairo/axiom.
